{"id":"f222b74804c56f9b","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-dekker.md","title":"Dekker 缺陷集定理","display":"thm-dekker — Dekker 缺陷集定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-dekker","aliases":["20-thm-dekker"],"display":"thm-dekker — Dekker 缺陷集定理","chapter":"5","section":"5.3.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.3.6(i)–(iv)","source_pdf_pages":[150],"source_printed_pages":[115],"depends_on":["[[20-df-deficiency]]","[[20-df-hypersimple]]","[[20-df-truth-table]]","[[20-df-principal-function]]","[[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]","[[20-df-teq]]","[[20-df-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-dekker"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-dekker</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dekker — Dekker 缺陷集定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.3.6(i)–(iv)"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>150</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>115</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dfd5eac03a7e2f83\" href=\"?note=dfd5eac03a7e2f83\" title=\"20-df-deficiency\">20-df-deficiency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76356b50167415cf\" href=\"?note=76356b50167415cf\" title=\"20-df-hypersimple\">20-df-hypersimple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"202d3cae13e0389b\" href=\"?note=202d3cae13e0389b\" title=\"20-df-truth-table\">20-df-truth-table</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"145fee39d6716fb8\" href=\"?note=145fee39d6716fb8\" title=\"20-df-principal-function\">20-df-principal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"680f7bcce5dddc10\" href=\"?note=680f7bcce5dddc10\" title=\"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound\">20-thm-hyperimmune-bound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 为固定全可计算单射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s=\\{f(t):t\\le s\\}\">\\(A_s=\\{f(t):t\\le s\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_f\">\\(D_f\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_f=\\omega\\setminus D_f\">\\(T_f=\\omega\\setminus D_f\\)</span> 是缺陷集及真阶段集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\\)</span> 为有限真值表归约。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"dfd5eac03a7e2f83\" href=\"?note=dfd5eac03a7e2f83\" title=\"20-df-deficiency\">20-df-deficiency</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"76356b50167415cf\" href=\"?note=76356b50167415cf\" title=\"20-df-hypersimple\">20-df-hypersimple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"202d3cae13e0389b\" href=\"?note=202d3cae13e0389b\" title=\"20-df-truth-table\">20-df-truth-table</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"145fee39d6716fb8\" href=\"?note=145fee39d6716fb8\" title=\"20-df-principal-function\">20-df-principal-function</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"680f7bcce5dddc10\" href=\"?note=680f7bcce5dddc10\" title=\"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound\">20-thm-hyperimmune-bound</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dekker}\\vdash\nD_f\\equiv_TA,\\qquad D_f\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(D_f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dekker}\\vdash\nD_f\\equiv_TA,\\qquad D_f\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(D_f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_f\">\\(D_f\\)</span> 是 c.e.，因为其定义中的见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t&gt;s\">\\(t&gt;s\\)</span> 可有效搜索。真阶段无限：任意给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>，取尾序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{f(t):t&gt;N\\}\">\\(\\{f(t):t&gt;N\\}\\)</span> 的最小值，它的唯一出现阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v&gt;N\">\\(v&gt;N\\)</span> 之后再无更小值，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in T_f\">\\(v\\in T_f\\)</span>。在严格递增真阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots\">\\(t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots\\)</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(t_i)\">\\(f(t_i)\\)</span> 也严格递增，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(t_i)\\ge i\">\\(f(t_i)\\ge i\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>给输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_f\">\\(D_f\\)</span> 可找第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+1\">\\(x+1\\)</span> 个真阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=p_{T_f}(x)\">\\(t=p_{T_f}(x)\\)</span>。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 后只枚举大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(t)\\ge x\">\\(f(t)\\ge x\\)</span> 的数，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\\iff x\\in A_t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in A\\iff x\\in A_t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_TD_f\">\\(A\\le_TD_f\\)</span>。反向更直接的有限布尔判据为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\in D_f\\iff\\exists y&lt;f(s)\\ [y\\in A\\land y\\notin A_s].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\in D_f\\iff\\exists y&lt;f(s)\\ [y\\in A\\land y\\notin A_s].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>询问所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y&lt;f(s)\">\\(y&lt;f(s)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 答案，并与可计算的有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span> 比较，给全定义真值表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(s)=0\">\\(f(s)=0\\)</span> 时空查询返回否。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_f\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}A\">\\(D_f\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}A\\)</span>，特别是两集合 Turing 等价。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{T_f}\">\\(p_{T_f}\\)</span> 最终有可计算上界，硬编码有限例外得逐点界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>。前式仍给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\\iff x\\in A_{g(x)}\">\\(x\\in A\\iff x\\in A_{g(x)}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算，矛盾。超免疫主函数表征于是给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_f\">\\(T_f\\)</span> 超免疫，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_f\">\\(D_f\\)</span> 超简单。编译这些归约时只需给定枚举函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的程序；oracle 为相应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_f\">\\(D_f\\)</span>，不隐藏非统一选择真阶段的步骤。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 115 / PDF 150。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-deficiency","status":"resolved","id":"dfd5eac03a7e2f83","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-deficiency]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hypersimple","status":"resolved","id":"76356b50167415cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hypersimple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"202d3cae13e0389b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-truth-table]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-principal-function","status":"resolved","id":"145fee39d6716fb8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-principal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-hyperimmune-bound","status":"resolved","id":"680f7bcce5dddc10","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-hyperimmune-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-teq","status":"resolved","id":"3dd875417abdd49f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-teq]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-deficiency","status":"resolved","id":"dfd5eac03a7e2f83","anchor":"ref-8","tar